WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,440
Isn't she afraid?

2
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:10,870
The coat color is light and refreshing

3
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:13,230
Why do you look so displeased?

4
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:17,570
