5
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:19,130
If you don't accept it

6
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:20,930
Then I'll throw it away again

7
00:00:20,930 --> 00:00:23,500
Master doesn't want it

8
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:31,710
She's quite pretty

9
