Then keep it

10
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:36,850
Then just take a long time

11
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:38,570
Can you two make peace?

12
00:00:38,770 --> 00:00:40,650
Sorry little mouse

13
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:42,370
It was all my fault just now

14
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:43,730
scared you

15
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:54,740
Forgive me, will you, young master?

16
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,180
what is he talking about

17
00:00:57,630 --> 00:00:59,630
He said he forgives you
